{#
  BeMart admin 2段階認証 (challenge) — EC-CUBE admin two_factor_auth.

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 admin-theme `two_factor_auth.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/admin/two_factor_auth.twig).

  This is a top-level wave login-context FORM page. It extends the admin
  LOGIN frame (`admin-login-base.html.twig`, the port of EC-CUBE's
  `login_frame.twig`) — EC-CUBE's `two_factor_auth.twig` likewise
  `{% extends '@admin/login_frame.twig' %}`. The markup skeleton +
  Bootstrap classes are kept verbatim; only the dynamic bindings are
  rebound to the TwoFactorAuth resource body
  (src/Resource/Page/Admin/TwoFactorAuth.php).

  FORM-PAGE recipe (Ray.WebFormModule — see var/templates/README.md):
  the resource exposes an
  {@see \MyVendor\BeMart\Form\AdminTwoFactorAuthForm} as `body['form']`.
  The token input renders through that real form object:

    {{ form.input('deviceToken')|raw }}

  EC-CUBE renders the same input through the Symfony FormView
  (`form_widget(form.device_token)`); Ray.WebFormModule is BeMart's
  BEAR-idiomatic equivalent.

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (see var/templates/README.md, "Admin pages"):
   - `{{ 'key'|trans }}`  -> the ja literal from messages.ja.yaml.
   - canonical form action -> `/admin/two-factor-auth`.
   - `form_widget(form._token)` -> EC-CUBE per-request CSRF widget. The
     hidden `_token` input is kept (structure) with an empty value;
     EC-CUBE-runtime only — enumerated as residual.
   - `{% if error %}` -> EC-CUBE's auth-error string. The thin-renderer
     resource surfaces a domain rejection through `body.message` (none
     for a pristine GET); rendered in the same `text-danger` block.
   - `form_errors(form.device_token)` -> inline field error; renders
     nothing for the pristine form, exactly as EC-CUBE.
   - `"now"|date("Y")` -> the current year, inlined as a literal.
#}
{% extends 'admin-login-base.html.twig' %}

{% set title = '2段階認証' %}

{% block main %}

    <div class="container" style="margin-top: 150px;">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-12 col-md-6 offset-md-3 col-lg-4 offset-lg-4">
                <div class="text-center p-5 bg-white">
                    <form name="form1" id="form1" method="post" action="/admin/two-factor-auth">
                        <input type="hidden" id="admin_two_factor_auth__token" name="csrfToken" value="{{ csrfToken|default(csrf_token()) }}">
                        <p><img src="{{ asset('assets/img/logo2.png', 'admin') }}" alt="BeMart" width="106"></p>
                        <h5 class="mb-3">2段階認証</h5>

                        {% if message is defined and message %}
                            <div class="text-danger mb-3 text-start small">{{ message }}</div>
                        {% endif %}

                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-12">
                                <div class="mb-3 d-flex justify-content-center">
                                    {{ form.input('deviceToken')|raw }}
                                </div>
                                {% if form.error('deviceToken') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('deviceToken') }}</span>{% endif %}
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12">
                                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary w-100">認証</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-12">
                <p class="text-center mt-3">
                    <small>Copyright &copy; 2026 BeMart. All Rights Reserved.</small>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

{% endblock %}
